  466  ### demo-data.js
  467: Purpose: Constructs and serves the deterministic curated demonstration dataset connecting the Official Academic Team: Sukhmanpreet Kaur and Sonam Verma , three architectural spaces, three scheduled exhibitions, twelve conceptual artworks, and twelve non-overlapping placements.
  468  - formatOffsetDate(days): Computes calendar date strings offset from today's date for dynamic relative exhibition scheduling. Called from: getDemoExhibitions.

docs\PRD.md:
  321  ### Curated Content Structure
  322: - **Academic Team Attribution (2)**: Official Academic Team: Sukhmanpreet Kaur (Paper & Structural Geometry) and Sonam Verma (Architectural Light & Spatial Form). Student team profiles distinguish factual research and academic backgrounds from fictional coursework demonstration scenarios. 
  323  - **Architectural Spaces (3)**: North Gallery (Capacity: 6, primary hall), Project Room (Capacity: 4, visual studies), Screening Alcove (Capacity: 3, lens-based research).
